# Graph · health and schema.
# Se ejecutan con la extensión REST Client de VS Code ("Send Request" sobre cada una) o con httpyac.
# Requires Neo4j: NEO4J_PASSWORD=... uv run prueba-chunking serve (standalone graph server: uv run prueba-chunking-data serve,
# then @graph = http://127.0.0.1:8001). Docs: http://127.0.0.1:8000/data/docs

@graph = http://127.0.0.1:8000/data

### graph · health: the server answers and Neo4j accepts the credentials (503 if not)
GET {{graph}}/health

### graph · schema: allowed labels and relationships
GET {{graph}}/schema
